<title>MALAYSIA: MALAYSIA BANK BUMIPUTRA YEAR INCOME UP 29 PCT.</title>
<headline>MALAYSIA BANK BUMIPUTRA YEAR INCOME UP 29 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income	     1,606.10	vs	   1,247.20</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   724.30	vs	     547.30</p>
<p>    Gross interest income 3,961.70     vs	   2,987.90</p>
<p>    Non-interest income    425.10	vs	     359.70</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank Bumputra Malaysia Bhd is owned by the Ministry of Finance Inc, a government body. It is Malaysia's second biggest bank.</p>
